{{/*
===============================================================================
NOTES.txt — message displayed after an installation or an upgrade
===============================================================================
File generated by forge. Rendered by Helm at the end of "helm install" and of
"helm upgrade", it recalls what has just been deployed and the immediate
verification commands.
===============================================================================
*/}}
Chart "{{ .Chart.Name }}" version {{ .Chart.Version }} (application {{ .Chart.AppVersion }})
Release "{{ .Release.Name }}" deployed in the "{{ .Release.Namespace }}" namespace.
{{- if .Values.global.environment }}
Environment: {{ .Values.global.environment }}
{{- end }}

Deployed components:
[% for component in domain.components %]
{{- if [[ component.values_ref ]].enabled }}
  - [[ component.name ]] ([[ component.kind ]]): {{ include "[[ component.helper ]].fullname" . }}
{{- if [[ component.values_ref ]].replicaCount }} — {{ [[ component.values_ref ]].replicaCount }} replica(s)
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
[% endfor %]

Check the state of the deployment:

  kubectl --namespace {{ .Release.Namespace }} get pods \
    --selector app.kubernetes.io/instance={{ .Release.Name }}

Follow the logs:
[% for component in domain.components %]
{{- if [[ component.values_ref ]].enabled }}

  kubectl --namespace {{ .Release.Namespace }} logs \
    --selector app.kubernetes.io/component=[[ component.name ]] --follow --tail=100
{{- end }}
[% endfor %]
[% for component in domain.components %]
[% if component.has.service and not component.service.headless %]
{{- if and [[ component.values_ref ]].enabled [[ component.values_ref ]].service.enabled }}

Reach the "[[ component.name ]]" component from the local machine:

  kubectl --namespace {{ .Release.Namespace }} port-forward \
    svc/{{ include "[[ component.helper ]].fullname" . }} \
    8080:{{ [[ component.values_ref ]].service.port }}

  then open http://127.0.0.1:8080
{{- end }}
[% endif %]
[% endfor %]
[% if domain.extras.helm_tests %]

Run the tests embedded in the chart:

  helm test {{ .Release.Name }} --namespace {{ .Release.Namespace }}
[% endif %]
